NE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_OR","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7509701,"initDialog":750970101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1005],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":75097,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":750970101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4245405914,"text":"Huh? Is it just Paimon, or are the Statues of The Seven in Natlan a bit weird?","nextNodeIds":[750970102]},{"nodeId":750970102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":800784338,"text":"Shouldn't it be more... intense the first time you touch it? Like, there's a \"schwing\"-y sound, that kinda feeling?","nextNodeIds":[750970103,750970105]},{"nodeId":750970103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1168081082,"text":"Eh, seems normal enough to me?","nextNodeIds":[750970104]},{"nodeId":750970104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3602070922,"text":"But it really is kinda strange...","nextNodeIds":[750970108]},{"nodeId":750970108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3805945538,"text":"Hmm, how should Paimon put it... Well, she always felt that before, there'd be a stronger connection established when you touched Statues...","nextNodeIds":[750970109]},{"nodeId":750970109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2097717306,"text":"This time, it feels more like hitting a switch, like all that happened when you touched the Statue was that it lit up.","nextNodeIds":[750970110]},{"nodeId":750970110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":869663738,"text":"Right, right! Before, when you touched the Statues, you could feel the elemental power. But this time...","nextNodeIds":[750970111]},{"nodeId":750970111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":502269850,"text":"Does it have that Pyro feel, all lively and intense?","nextNodeIds":[750970112,750970113]},{"nodeId":750970112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1987296258,"text":"(You carefully search within yourself...)","nextNodeIds":[750970114]},{"nodeId":750970114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1098613954,"text":"Huh... Nothing at all...?","nextNodeIds":[750970115]},{"nodeId":750970115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1776010530,"text":"That seems kinda weird no matter how you look at it...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":750970113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":539842810,"text":"(There's none of the scorching sensation you expected...)","nextNodeIds":[750970114]},{"nodeId":750970105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3459515466,"text":"Actually, the \"schwing\" before was me.","nextNodeIds":[750970106]},{"nodeId":750970106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1981328058,"text":"Oh! So you just forgot to \"schwing\" this time, then? Well, next time, try to pay more attention...","nextNodeIds":[750970107]},{"nodeId":750970107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2893491554,"text":"AS IF! You better add your own sound effects every time you touch a Statue of The Seven!","nextNodeIds":[750970108]}]},{"talkId":7509703,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"